{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>太子今日（28日）發生猝斃意外。早上約11時14分，一名50歲男子在大南街64號唐樓家中暈倒，其家人發現後連忙報警求助。</p><p>救護員趕至，經檢查後證實事主已明顯死亡。警方將安排為事主驗屍確定死因。</p><figure><img alt=\"太子大南街64號唐樓一名住戶在家中暈倒，當場證實死亡。（Google Maps截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203397713438183424472180.jpeg/9bVYsg-rRQEMy36loKHA9taHgMgGIk11rZFK4a2RSuE\"/><figcaption>太子大南街64號唐樓一名住戶在家中暈倒，當場證實死亡。（Google Maps截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T09:36:39.339413+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T09:22:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T11:51:54.652321+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T09:30:15.398823+00:00","content_hash":"a29112417a7c5de09733a0e2550a3b0fe2244115e653d17b95e4e53378dc5d5c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}